# 8bit

--- Arcade_Double | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_ARCADE_DOUBLE_DESC
raw  8-Bit fires <!card.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionTriggerCount> projectiles. Consumes ammo.
now  8-Bit fires <!card.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionTriggerCount> projectiles. Consumes ammo.
  card.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionTriggerCount  -  -> 18

--- Arcade_Double | gadget | TID_ARCADE_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  8-Bit fires <!buddy.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionTriggerCount> projectiles that bounce to nearby enemies. Bouncing projectiles deal <!buddy.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionBullet.chainBullet.damagePercentStart>% damage. Consumes ammo.
now  8-Bit fires <!buddy.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionTriggerCount> projectiles that bounce to nearby enemies. Bouncing projectiles deal <!buddy.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionBullet.chainBullet.damagePercentStart>% damage. Consumes ammo.
  buddy.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionTriggerCount  -  -> 18
  buddy.accessory.skill.areaEffect.bulletExplosionBullet.chainBullet.damagePercentStart  -  -> 60

--- Arcade_Teleport | gadget | TID_ARCADE_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  8-Bit teleports to his Damage booster, healing himself for <!buddy.trait.value.scaleToLevel> and repairing the booster by <!buddy.trait[1].value>%.
now  8-Bit teleports to his Damage booster, healing himself for 3600 and repairing the booster by 100%.
  buddy.trait.value.scaleToLevel  3600  -> 3600
  buddy.trait[1].value  100  -> 100

--- Arcade_Teleport | gadget | TID_ARCADE_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DIFF
raw  Heals himself for <!buddy.trait.value.scaleToLevel>, and repairs the booster by <!buddy.trait[1].value>%.
now  Heals himself for 3600, and repairs the booster by 100%.
  buddy.trait.value.scaleToLevel  3600  -> 3600
  buddy.trait[1].value  100  -> 100

--- Arcade_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_ARCADE_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  8-Bit's turret now has a laser that shoots nearby enemies. Shots do <!card.character.ultiSkill.overchargedSummonedCharacter.autoAttackDamage> damage.
now  8-Bit's turret now has a laser that shoots nearby enemies. Shots do <!card.character.ultiSkill.overchargedSummonedCharacter.autoAttackDamage> damage.
  card.character.ultiSkill.overchargedSummonedCharacter.autoAttackDamage  -  -> 230

--- Arcade_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_LARGER_AREA_ULTI_DESC
raw  Increases the Damage Booster's range by <!arcade.largerAreaUlti.rangePercent>% and boosts damage by an additional <!arcade.largerAreaUlti.damageDelta>%.
now  Increases the Damage Booster's range by <!arcade.largerAreaUlti.rangePercent>% and boosts damage by an additional <!arcade.largerAreaUlti.damageDelta>%.
  arcade.largerAreaUlti.rangePercent  -  -> 50
  arcade.largerAreaUlti.damageDelta  -  -> 15

--- Arcade_unique | star power | TID_ARCADE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DESC
raw  Increase the Damage Booster's range by <!arcade.largerAreaUlti.rangePercent>% and damage by an additional <!arcade.largerAreaUlti.damageDelta>%. Every <!buddy.trait.component.value.ticksAsSeconds> sec the Damage Booster spawns ammo lasting <!buddy.trait.component.projectile.spawnItem.lifetime.ticksAsSeconds> sec and reloading 1 ammo.
now  Increase the Damage Booster's range by <!arcade.largerAreaUlti.rangePercent>% and damage by an additional <!arcade.largerAreaUlti.damageDelta>%. Every 5 sec the Damage Booster spawns ammo lasting <!buddy.trait.component.projectile.spawnItem.lifetime.ticksAsSeconds> sec and reloading 1 ammo.
  arcade.largerAreaUlti.rangePercent  -  -> 50
  arcade.largerAreaUlti.damageDelta  -  -> 15
  buddy.trait.component.value.ticksAsSeconds  5  -> 
  buddy.trait.component.projectile.spawnItem.lifetime.ticksAsSeconds  -  -> 8

--- Arcade_unique | star power | TID_ARCADE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DIFF
raw  Every <!buddy.trait.component.value.ticksAsSeconds> sec the Damage Booster spawns an ammo clip lasting <!buddy.trait.component.projectile.spawnItem.lifetime.ticksAsSeconds> sec and reloading 1 ammo.
now  Every 5 sec the Damage Booster spawns an ammo clip lasting <!buddy.trait.component.projectile.spawnItem.lifetime.ticksAsSeconds> sec and reloading 1 ammo.
  buddy.trait.component.value.ticksAsSeconds  5  -> 5
  buddy.trait.component.projectile.spawnItem.lifetime.ticksAsSeconds  -  -> 8

--- Arcade_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_PLUGGED_IN_DESC
raw  While near the Damage Booster 8-Bit gains +<!card.projectile.statusEffectAlly.speedBoostPercent>% Movement Speed.
now  While near the Damage Booster 8-Bit gains +25% Movement Speed.
  card.projectile.statusEffectAlly.speedBoostPercent  25  -> 25

--- Arcade_unique_2 | star power | TID_ARCADE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DESC
raw  While near the Damage Booster 8-Bit gains a <!card.projectile.statusEffectAlly.speedBoostPercent>% Speed Boost and teammates get a <!buddy.trait.projectile.statusEffectAlly.baseSpeedIncreasePercent>% Speed Boost.
now  While near the Damage Booster 8-Bit gains a 25% Speed Boost and teammates get a 10% Speed Boost.
  card.projectile.statusEffectAlly.speedBoostPercent  25  -> 25
  buddy.trait.projectile.statusEffectAlly.baseSpeedIncreasePercent  10  -> 10

--- Arcade_unique_2 | star power | TID_ARCADE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DIFF
raw  Teammates get a <!buddy.trait.projectile.statusEffectAlly.baseSpeedIncreasePercent>% Speed Boost.
now  Teammates get a 10% Speed Boost.
  buddy.trait.projectile.statusEffectAlly.baseSpeedIncreasePercent  10  -> 10
